{
  "case_id": "HANNA-PASSWINDOW-1.21.1",
  "title": "人偶师立牌「路过友方玩家」：口径 B（水平 ≤3.0 + 脚底高差 ≤2.0）—— +3 格拒、水平 3.5 拒、+2 格接受",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "hanna-sign-pass-window"
  },
  "on_fail": "keep_game_running",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：验证人偶师立牌「路过友方玩家（幻想千金）」在**口径 B**（水平 ≤3.0 格 + 脚底高差 ≤2.0 格）下的三条边界，并证明旧 AABB 盒判据才是「跨高度触发」的成因。\n\n**读数**：`hannaread` 的 `craft`（「人偶制作」层数真值）—— 触发一次 +1 且写入 `cd_fantasy=now+1200`；未触发则两者不变。\n**必须先把两段拒绝测完再测接受段**：接受会消耗一次 60 秒冷却，顺序反了第三段永远不触发（假阴性）。\n**第二玩家**：Carpet 的 `/player Bot spawn at ~x ~y ~z` 造真 ServerPlayer；抬高用 `setblock` 垫脚石，使 bot 脚底精确落在目标高度（bot 的登录行会打印精确坐标，是最硬的高度证据）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule naturalRegeneration false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/time set midnight",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule advance_time false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/carpet allowSpawningOfflinePlayers true",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/kill @e[type=!player,distance=..48]",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/tp @s ~ ~ ~ 0 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signprep H0 \"astral_dice:hanna_sign\"",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe hannaread H0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "A 段（拒绝）：bot 脚底置于佩戴者脚底 **+3 格**（仍落在旧 AABB 的 +4.8 内）⇒ 期望 `craft=0`。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/setblock ~2 ~2 ~2 stone",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/player BotH spawn at ~2 ~3 ~2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe hannaread HA",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/player BotH kill",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "B 段（拒绝）：bot 同高但**水平推远 1 格**（`at ~3.5 ~ ~0` ⇒ 水平 3.5 格；旧 AABB 的 ±3.6 会误收）⇒ 期望 `craft=0`。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/player BotH spawn at ~3.5 ~ ~0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe hannaread HB",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/player BotH kill",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "C 段（接受）：bot 脚底置于佩戴者脚底 **+2 格**（= 窗口上边界，含跳跃 1.25 / 台阶 1）⇒ 期望 `craft=1` 且 `cd_fantasy` 被写入。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/setblock ~2 ~1 ~2 stone",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/player BotH spawn at ~2 ~2 ~2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 2200
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe hannaread HC",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/player BotH kill",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 900
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signprep H9 \"astral_dice:hanna_sign\"",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_H0_HANNA:craft=0:complete=0:float=0:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_HA_HANNA:craft=0:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_HB_HANNA:craft=0:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_HC_HANNA:craft=1:complete=0:float=0:cd_fantasy=[1-9][0-9]*:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "logged in with entity id [0-9]+ at \\([^,]+, -57\\.0, "
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "logged in with entity id [0-9]+ at \\([^,]+, -58\\.0, "
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_[A-Z0-9]+_ERR"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": ":err="
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "参数后应有空格分隔|未知或不完整的命令|Unknown or incomplete command|Incorrect argument"
    },
    {
      "type": "kubejs"
    },
    {
      "type": "crash"
    }
  ]
}
